#### jump-coil — the v2 case coils-jumps-splits/jump-coil, as a pull writes it
=== text
%LANGUAGE LD
%NETWORK
IF a AND b THEN JMP Done; END_IF;
%NETWORK
Done:
x := TRUE;
=== model
NETWORK
  (jmp Done (AND a b))
NETWORK label:Done
  (:= x TRUE)

